  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: packet over-reads in the mysqlnd wire protocol parser\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-1218.patch: bound every packet reader and the\n       text and binary row decoders in ext/mysqlnd/mysqlnd_wireprotocol.c and\n       ext/mysqlnd/mysqlnd_ps_codec.c, including the CVE-2024-8929 checks they\n       build on. Not carried: upstream's caching_sha2 and MariaDB hunks (code\n       absent in 7.0) and its regression tests (PHP 8 test harness).\n     - CVE-2025-1218",
